{"id": 1276, "updated": "2026-10-14", "episodes": [{"n": 1, "t": "And then, we start spinning once more", "e": {"sub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/5062/sub", "dub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/5062/dub"}}, {"n": 2, "t": "Unable to say what you want", "e": {"sub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/5063/sub", "dub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/5063/dub"}}, {"n": 3, "t": "I don&#39;t want to see your tears", "e": {"sub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/5064/sub", "dub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/5064/dub"}}, {"n": 4, "t": "I won&#39;t let you go anywhere", "e": {"sub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/5065/sub", "dub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/5065/dub"}}, {"n": 5, "t": "Suffering even though I&#39;m happy", "e": {"sub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/5066/sub", "dub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/5066/dub"}}, {"n": 6, "t": "We would never go to the beach", "e": {"sub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/5067/sub", "dub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/5067/dub"}}, {"n": 7, "t": "Forward, in the direction of the light", "e": {"sub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/5068/sub", "dub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/5068/dub"}}, {"n": 8, "t": "We didn&#39;t know anything", "e": {"sub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/5069/sub", "dub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/5069/dub"}}, {"n": 9, "t": "Pondering my inabilities", "e": {"sub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/5070/sub", "dub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/5070/dub"}}, {"n": 10, "t": "Once, when I was little, I saw God", "e": {"sub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/5071/sub", "dub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/5071/dub"}}, {"n": 11, "t": "Please give me your life", "e": {"sub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/5072/sub", "dub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/5072/dub"}}, {"n": 12, "t": "With honey and clover", "e": {"sub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/5073/sub", "dub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/5073/dub"}}]}